  "blocks": [
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Explore Marina Harbor Detox"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Tour Our Facility"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Recovery starts in the right environment. Explore Marina Harbor Detox and discover comfortable living spaces, clinical support areas, and waterfront surroundings designed to help patients focus on healing."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our San Francisco Drug & Alcohol Detox Facility"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our private, upscale 6-room facility offers spectacular views of the San Francisco Bay Area near the Golden Gate Bridge and allows you the comfort and amenities of a 5-star hotel. We provide a warm, home like environment that is located in the heart of one of the country’s most sought-after neighborhoods, which produces a peaceful and serene atmosphere that is unparalleled."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We offer private, well-appointed rooms with internet access, flat screen TV’s and meals/organic snacks prepared specifically for you. We only serve a maximum of 6 clients at a time, ensuring that you get the personal care and attention you deserve during this difficult time. Each room is equipped with a private bathroom and shower, to ensure utmost comfort and privacy for our clients."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Tour Our San Francisco Facility"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Indoor Spaces"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Outdoor Spaces"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "If the client requires medically supervised or sub-acute detoxification, Marina Harbor offers an individualized, medically monitored alcohol and drug detox that is closely supervised by a team of detoxification specialists.Our physicians have many decades of experience managing the symptoms of withdrawal and utilize a wide range of safe and effective medications to help manage the physical symptoms."
    }
  ],
